  "description": "Local-first email for agents: IMAP sync to maildir + SQLite (FTS5); CLI search, read, thread, who, attachments. Requires Node 20+, npm install (`npm install -g @cirne/zmail` or `npx @cirne/zmail`), native better-sqlite3 (rebuilt on first run if Node ABI mismatch), and IMAP credentials. OpenAI API key required for `zmail setup` / wizard, `zmail ask`, and `zmail inbox`—those features can send email-derived text to OpenAI. Optional `who --enrich` may call third-party search APIs. Source: github.com/cirne/zmail.",
